# Lint and Format Standard

After completing each coding iteration (before handing work back to the user), always run:

```bash
bun run fix
```

This runs ESLint with auto-fix, then Prettier formatting.

If `bun run fix` reports remaining ESLint errors, resolve them manually and run `bun run fix` again until clean.

Before opening a PR or finishing a larger task, also run:

```bash
bun run check
```

`check` runs non-mutating verification (`format:check` + `lint`) and must pass with no errors.
